VERIFY={
'm8c05':'''- 1991 bloom: late1991 and roughly1000km are supported; sources differ slightly in rounded extent. [CSIRO account](https://www.csiro.au/en/news/All/Articles/2016/May/toxic-algal-blooms-new-normal-for-australias-major-rivers) and the [research paper on2018-19](https://doi.org/10.1071/MF21038) support the contextual cases, not a claim that all historical kills followed this exact simple lake chain.
- 2018-19 Menindee: repeated events, low-flow/heat/stratification and oxygen depletion are supported. Keep "estimated" for the fish count and separate it from the1991 bloom.
- Nitrate50mg/L asNO3 is the health guideline protecting bottle-fed infants under3months. [NHMRC nitrate](https://guidelines.nhmrc.gov.au/australian-drinking-water-guidelines/part-5/physical-chemical-characteristics/nitrate-and-nitrite). Do not compare ion-basis numbers withN/P-basis guidelines without conversion.
- E.coli is the preferred recent faecal indicator; total coliforms include environmental organisms. [NHMRC E.coli](https://guidelines.nhmrc.gov.au/australian-drinking-water-guidelines/part-5/microorganisms/microbial-indicators/escherichia-coli).
- The sample tables are teaching data. The chemical/physical/biological categories, diffuse farm runoff and a point outlet, turbidity and conductivity limitations are appropriate. Colourimetry needs the stated reagent/standards; ion chromatography separates ions. No treatment process is added.''',
'm8c06':'''- March2023 Menindee: hypoxia most likely proximate cause is confirmed by the [ChiefScientist executive summary](https://www.chiefscientist.nsw.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0022/1597/Menindee-Fish-Deaths-Report_Findings-and-Recommendations.pdf). The [DPI July2023 submission p4](https://www.chiefscientist.nsw.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0013/1606/DPI-Fisheries-Submission-to-Independent-Review-into-Menindee-Fish-Deaths-2023.pdf) specifically records first-light observations. Attribute observation toDPI rather than asserting a new precise time series.
- Winkler: all three displayed equations balance atom and charge counts. MnO(OH)2 is an accepted representation of the brown product. The1:4 oxygen:thiosulfate ratio is confirmed by the [UBC protocol](https://www.eoas.ubc.ca/~swaterma/473-573/Handouts/Winkler.pdf) and [Hach method](https://cdn.hach.com/7FYZVWYB/at/5nh4tqx6sz6p35zs64xs959/ex_oxydissolved.pdf). Immediate fixing without bubbles, starch near the endpoint and calibrated probe checks are appropriate.
- About9.1mg/L at20degrees and7.6at30degrees fit fresh-water air-saturation tables at normal pressure. See finding2 for the limit.
- Dark,20degrees,five-day conditions are confirmed; simple subtraction needs an undiluted sample and usable residual oxygen. Method interferences remain author notes unless necessary for the question. No azide handling is taught.''',
'm8c08':'''- Bromine-water loss is useful evidence for unsaturation within a restricted candidate set, not universally specific toC=C. An alkane can transfer bromine into its organic layer without reaction; retain theP02 "gone, not moved" interpretation wherever layers are visible.
- Hydrogen carbonate/acid and limewater equations balance. Alcohols are too weakly acidic to give this fizz under the stated conditions. Primary/secondary alcohols reduce acidified dichromate; tertiary alcohols do not under the ordinary test. Aldehydes interfere. The alkene negative is not cleared by these facts.
- With sufficient acidity permanganate is reduced toMn2+, while neutral/mildly alkaline conditions commonly giveMnO2. Acidification and temperature affect organic products, so do not imply all oxidations stop at a diol. The site wording needs the acid/neutral distinction.
- Formulae and names in the worked cases were recounted; no imbalance found. Some physical constants are author notes only. The exact alkene-negative premise remains open; no experimental result has been invented.''',
'm8p05c':'''- The plan contains aim, independent variable (liquid), dependent observation and controlled volumes, temperature, time, light and background. TheS07 reliability and accuracy language is appropriate for qualitative observations once validity is repaired.
- Cr(VI) teacher demonstration in a fume cupboard is the settled approach and is retained. Solid potassium dichromate is carcinogenicH350, not suspectedH351. [Merck hazard meanings](https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/GB/en/life-science/safety/hazard-and-precautionary-statements).
- The1mol/L sulfuric acid and dilute bromine classifications depend on their exact formulation/SDS. Solid calcium hydroxide codes must not be silently transferred to saturated limewater. The design distinguishes solid versus mixture but still needs exact local SDS documentation.
- 2-methylpropan-2-ol may be solid near room temperature; gentle water-bath warming is consistent with its use. No flame, small amounts, closed bottles, no smell identification and separate labelled chromium/organic waste are appropriate. Do not pour chromium-containing organics into a general waste bottle without the school's specified stream.
- No exact bottle-mixture SDS, teacher trial or bromine concentration was inspected. Consequently the complete risk table and demonstrated colour timing are not certified.''',
'm8b09':'''- The normal growth role of proto-oncogenes, activating oncogene effects and usual two-hit loss of suppressor function are suitable simplifications with stated assumptions. BRCA1 increases risk without certainty. Do not imply every suppressor is a simple two-copy switch.
- UV exposure as the principal environmental cause of most cutaneous melanoma, melanocytes as pigment cells, andBRAF activation in many cases are supported. BRAF activation alone does not establish cancer; benign nevi can also carryBRAF changes. [NIH mole genetics](https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/understanding/traits/moles/).
- Invasion, vessel entry, survival, exit and growth at a new site describe metastasis. A lymph-node secondary remains melanoma. Most cancer deaths involve metastatic disease. These claims are supported; do not require every melanoma to reach a node before a distant organ.
- AIHW2025 projections:17,443 new melanoma cases and1,455 deaths; five-year relative survival94% in2017-2021. The current report rates use the2025 population. These are dated contextual data, not personal prognosis.
- A benign tumour not metastasising is correct while it is benign. Reject the author's proposed site correction claiming that possible future malignant transformation makes this statement false. Similarly, do not replace an Australian comparison with two risks measured to different ages and call them directly comparable.''',
'm8b10':'''- Worked and attempt arithmetic is checked below. The80,000 population is acceptable as a teaching city and as a simple population-based surveillance denominator; it is not the disease-free denominator of cumulative incidence. [CDC incidence distinctions](https://archive.cdc.gov/www_cdc_gov/csels/dsepd/ss1978/lesson3/section2.html).
- Point prevalence is a snapshot; prevalence may also be measured over a period. The lesson's snapshot version is appropriate when explicitly labelled. Mortality uses population, whereas case fatality uses diagnosed cases.
- AIHW's current overview supports rising cancer death counts and falling adjusted mortality. The2025-standard aggregate is about257in2000 to194in2025; about36,000deaths in2000 to53,500projected in2025. The full1995-2025annualseries has now been extracted fromBook2a,TableS2a.1with both standard populations; use its2001column for this design. The crude rate changes190.0to193.6per100,000, while2001-standardmortality declines208.6to142.7. Counts34216to53545rise overall but not monotonically.
- Diabetes is long-lasting and improved survival can increase prevalence at steady incidence. The tap/tank is useful if recovery and death remain outflows. Screening can alter detected incidence. These mechanisms support possible explanations rather than uniquely determining them.''',
'm8b11':'''- Original1950TableI:709case-control pairs, including649men and60women. Among men647cases and622controls were smokers.622is not the total control group. [OriginalBMJ1950](https://www.bmj.com/content/bmj/2/4682/739.full.pdf).
- Original1954TableIV confirms0.00,0.48,0.67,1.14; units and age condition are in finding3. The questionnaire was sent in1951 and about40,000responded. The fifty-year2004analysis followed34,439men; do not confuse all respondents with that analytic cohort.
- Doll stopped smoking in1949, not after the1954cohort report. The [BMJ2005obituary](https://www.bmj.com/content/suppl/2005/07/28/331.7511.295.DC1) links quitting to the early association; [BCMedicalJournal historical account](https://bcmj.org/sites/default/files/BCMJ_54_Vol4_tobacco.pdf) gives1949. No quitting year is spoken in this design.
- [AIHW2016fortification assessment](https://www.aihw.gov.au/reports/food-nutrition/folic-acid-iodine-fortification/contents/summary/outcome) supports reductions, with larger reductions in some initially higher-risk groups. The question does not need new percentages or named population labels.
- The observational/experimental distinction, case-control backward comparison, prospective cohort and confounding discussion are sound after the listed absolute claims are repaired. The benefit chain is a useful evaluation method, not proof that a single study caused every policy or outcome.''',
'm8g01b':'''- Q1 andQ3 are explicitly illustrative. The numerical rates and percentages are right.9%versus4%is2.25times; "about twice" is acceptable. This is prevalence ratio, not an incident relative risk or evidence of causation.
- Q2 is labelled illustrative data shaped on Australian trends, not an exactAIHWseries. Keep that label visible in the completed graph caption as well as the question. The ten-point line graph must use five-year spacing at the final interval. Never replace the coded graph withAIart.
- Cross-sectional measurement cannot establish timing in this survey. Possible reverse causality, self-report, selection and confounding are appropriate critiques. The proposed cohort records baseline exposure in people without diabetes and follows new disease, appropriately improving the temporal evidence.
- B11 is a prerequisite forQ3's four-step frame, cohort comparison and confounder concept. The settled placement afterB11 is correct. Longer walkthroughs are permitted because these worked answers are the lesson content.'''}

